### 查询发票属性
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/invoices/attributes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"BR","marketplaceId":"A2Q3Y263D00KWC"}

### 查询发票导出文档
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/invoices/documents/get
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"BR","invoicesDocumentId":"DOC-123"}

### 创建发票导出
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/invoices/exports/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"BR","exportBody":{"marketplaceId":"A2Q3Y263D00KWC","dateStart":"2026-08-01T00:00:00Z","dateEnd":"2026-08-07T23:59:59Z","fileFormat":"XML","statuses":["AUTHORIZED"]}}

### 查询发票导出列表
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/invoices/exports/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"BR","marketplaceId":"A2Q3Y263D00KWC","dateStart":"2026-08-01T00:00:00Z","pageSize":20,"statuses":["AUTHORIZED"]}

### 查询指定发票导出
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/invoices/exports/get
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"BR","exportId":"EXPORT-123"}

### 创建政府发票
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/invoices/government-invoices/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"BR","governmentInvoiceBody":{"marketplaceId":"A2Q3Y263D00KWC","shipmentId":"SHIPMENT-123","invoiceType":"REMITTANCE","transactionType":"INBOUND_SHIPMENT"}}

### 查询政府发票状态
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/invoices/government-invoices/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"BR","marketplaceId":"A2Q3Y263D00KWC","shipmentId":"SHIPMENT-123","invoiceType":"REMITTANCE","transactionType":"INBOUND_SHIPMENT"}

### 查询政府发票文档
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/invoices/government-invoices/document
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"BR","marketplaceId":"A2Q3Y263D00KWC","shipmentId":"SHIPMENT-123","invoiceType":"REMITTANCE","transactionType":"INBOUND_SHIPMENT","fileFormat":"XML"}

### 查询发票列表
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/invoices/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"BR","marketplaceId":"A2Q3Y263D00KWC","dateStart":"2026-08-01T00:00:00Z","dateEnd":"2026-08-07T23:59:59Z","statuses":["AUTHORIZED"],"pageSize":20}

### 查询发票详情
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/invoices/get
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"BR","marketplaceId":"A2Q3Y263D00KWC","invoiceId":"INV-123"}
